Exports and raw CLI results are saved beside this report. The `before` and `after` exports document the configuration change in a full run. RouterOS exports omit sensitive values unless explicitly requested, so they are not complete password backups.

Ansible applies and collects configuration consistently across both devices. CPU, memory and ping describe the virtual lab at this instant; they do not establish that Ansible improves router performance or network throughput.
